            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, in the same way as with a regular `git commit` by using several `-m` flags:\r\n`:Git commit -m My\\ commit -m Another\\ line`",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Yes, in the same way as with a regular <code class=\"notranslate\">git commit</code> by using several <code class=\"notranslate\">-m</code> flags:<br>\n<code class=\"notranslate\">:Git commit -m My\\ commit -m Another\\ line</code></p>",
